  "behavior": [
    "ChatTarget Session/Finding/TestCasesDraft. Canonical rich record snapshot captured synchronously when Send begins, from current local editor records.",
    "Schema 15 to 16 adds immutable version-1 context adjunct keyed by stable user message ID in the original turn transaction. Old messages default to Session context.",
    "Backend checks Session ownership, record existence and Testware draft kind. Backend computes local fingerprint and a separate stored base token. Retry retains the original context even after new saved edits or service reopen.",
    "Context limits are 32 KiB per snapshot and 128 KiB aggregate. Existing text, image and provider frame limits remain. Oversize sends retain composer and dirty records.",
    "One mounted SessionChatView reuses composer, images, provider/model controls, job, cancellation, permissions, explicit reset and Note handoff. Context detach affects future sends. Notes sends explicitly use Session context.",
    "Saved manual/generated records expose Ask AI beside Copy/Edit. Record list hides while panel is active. At workspace widths below 850 px chat uses full content. Collection remains its own scrollport.",
    "Panel styles live in ask-ai.css. Existing summary recovery refs extracted into a typed domain hook to retain the 500-line policy."
  ],
